  "title": "Glade punks fik cykelkrig og veganske hotdogs",
  "publishedAt": "2012-06-25T22:35:02+02:00",
  "modifiedAt": "2013-06-13T23:43:07+02:00",
  "authors": [
    "Adrian Utzon Dietz"
